    "Deploy The Five-Dollar Free Work Strategy. Find five influential leaders in the industry you want to dominate. Spend two weeks studying their businesses, their content, and their public pain points. Create a tailored, high-value asset for each of them: an automated lead distribution blueprint, a redesigned landing page, five high-converting email newsletter drafts, or a comprehensive competitor analysis report.",
